haviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tHeadpeckers retarget very often, usually to the player with the lowest current health in range.<br/><br/>A headpecker attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Its experience was decreased from 13,950 to 12,026 on July 28, 2022.\n</p>\n<ul><li>As announced on July 29, 2025, the patch increased its XP from 12026 to 12930.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,934 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.43</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"42.554292\" style=\"text-align:center;\">43%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Crystal Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Coin_55f849.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.32</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"31.540848\" style=\"text-align:center;\">32%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:Fi